// # emit-x86 three println
//
// Logline: Print 1 then hi then 2 so emit-x86 can lower three sequential println statements.
//
// Setup: Product path is oodac emit-x86 on this file, then as and ld. No greet. No concat.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Declare main.
//   2. Print the const integer 1.
//   3. Print the const string hi then the const integer 2.

pub fn main() {
    println(1);
    println("hi");
    println(2);
}
